    "description": "<p>The Mental Invisibility Technique bends the minds of those who might observe the character. The Exalt's player rolls ([Dexterity or Manipulation] + Stealth), adding her Essence in automatic successes. This Charm exerts unnatural mental influence on all those who observe her. If the character's successes exceed a target's Dodge MDV, the target is compelled to ignore the Solar's presence whenever the Solar is not joined in battle (see p. 141). The target must spend four Willpower to resist this compulsion, which drops to one Willpower if someone calls the target's attention to the Solar.</p>",
